Attribution

This project is derived from [billion-context](https://github.com/ranxianglei/billion-context)
(MIT License, © 2026 ranxianglei). Compression philosophy, ref-tag mechanics,
block state model, and kernel concepts from billion-context are used under the
terms of the MIT License.

nano-context adds: in-process architecture (no proxy), reversible compression,
incremental rendering, graceful restart detection, structured metrics, and a
DSH-native plugin contract.
